 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** Not given in the sources.
-- **Memory Complexity:** Not given in the sources.
+- **Time Complexity:** Not given in the sources [S1][S2, unofficial].
+- **Memory Complexity:** Not given in the sources [S1][S2, unofficial].
 - **Measured Performance:** For a $256^3$ volume, the total runtime is roughly 50 minutes [S1][S2, unofficial].
-- **Strengths:** Effectively avoids local minima associated with non-monotonic TFs by using a color volume as an intermediate representation. Provides a robust initialization for final density optimization [S1][S2, unofficial].
-- **Limitations:** Fine details may be lost, and spurious noise may remain due to ambiguities in mapping colors back to densities. Transparent regions may be incorrectly mapped to zero density [S1][S2, unofficial].
-- **When to Use:** When using non-monotonic transfer functions in differentiable volume rendering and standard density optimization fails due to local minima.
-- **When Not to Use:** When monotonic transfer functions are sufficient, or when real-time performance is critical and the overhead of the two-stage optimization is unacceptable.
